<title>USA: International Retail group joins anti-VISA suit.</title>
<headline>International Retail group joins anti-VISA suit.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Mass Retail Association said on Friday it will join a class-action anti-trust lawsuit against VISA USA Inc and MasterCard International.</p>
<p>The lawsuit, originally filed by Wal-Mart Stores Inc and the Limited Inc, seeks to prevent VISA and MasterCard from requiring retailers to accept their debit cards as well as their credit cards.</p>
<p>On Thursday the National Retail Federation said it would join the lawsuit.</p>
</text>
